{"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "Before I run everything, here is where the levels are counted, so you can see what else reads `level`:\n\n```rust\nuse std::collections::HashMap;\n\n/// Every level the parser has seen, with how often, for the summary the CLI prints at the end of a tail session.\npub fn summarize(entries: &[Entry]) -> HashMap<String, usize> {\n    let mut counts: HashMap<String, usize> = HashMap::with_capacity(entries.len().min(16));\n    for e in entries.iter().filter(|e| !e.level.is_empty() && e.level != \"trace\" && e.level != \"debu"}}, "session_id": "af9c8cb7-9d7a-4b6b-9753-95decd27b4f6", "parent_tool_use_id": null, "api_message_id": "msg_review0011"}
